A **Copy Constructor** is a specialized constructor that creates a new object as an exact, independent duplicate of an existing object of the same class:
```java
public Student(Student other) {
    this.id = other.id;
    this.name = other.name;
    this.courses = new ArrayList<>(other.courses); // Deep copy of mutable list!
}
